; MOUSE.LGO - draw with the mouse
;
; MOUSEON takes five instruction lists: what to do when the left button
; goes down, when it comes up, the same for the right button, and when
; the mouse moves. The program keeps running in the background while
; the lists react to the mouse. Press Stop to finish.

make "drawing "false
to down
  make "drawing "true
  penup setpos mousepos pendown
end
to move
  if :drawing [setpos mousepos]
end

clearscreen
setpensize 3
setpencolor [200 70 140]
mouseon [down] [make "drawing "false] [clean] [] [move]
print [Hold the left button down and move the mouse to draw. Right-click to clear.]
forever [wait 6]
